    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "From October 9 to 11, the voice of Jay Chou once again filled the Shanghai Stadium. Each night, nearly 60,000 fans came to watch his "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Carnival World Tour"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "“嘉年华”世界巡演"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " concert. The three shows broke the record for the biggest concert crowd in the stadium’s history."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The Carnival tour first started in 2019 to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "mark",
            "ref": "v-mark"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Jay’s 20 years in music. For six years, the tour has travelled the world, lighting up over 110 stages. It all started in Shanghai. And now, Jay has returned to the same city, bringing even more energy and joy to his fans."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "At each of the Shanghai concerts, Jay sang over 40 of his greatest "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "hits",
            "ref": "v-hit"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The crowd sang along to songs such as "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Blue and White Porcelain"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "《青花瓷》"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Mojito"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "《莫吉托》"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Colourful lights waved through the air, and every beat of the music made everyone cheer. On the last night in Shanghai, Jay ended the show with "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Common Jasmine Orange"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "《七里香》"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He thanked his band and dancers and walked off the stage. But the fans weren’t ready to say goodbye. They stayed, shouting his name again and again for an "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "encore",
            "ref": "v-encore"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "After the Shanghai concerts, Jay shared some big news: A brand-new world tour is coming next year! According to him, each city will have its own special "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "theme",
            "ref": "v-theme"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and name, so every concert will be special."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Jay Chou’s music mixes many styles such as R&B, rock, and classical music. His songs use simple words but carry deep feelings. Many of them are very popular abroad and even help foreign people learn about Chinese culture. For fans, his music has been the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "soundtrack",
            "zh": "电影声带"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to their lives. As this tour ends, a new journey begins!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
